    "innovation": "This paper introduces a novel mass-conserving Eulerian algorithm that simulates glacier dynamics by solving a volume of fluid (VOF) transport equation on a structured grid for surface evolution, coupled with a full Stokes ice flow model on a separate unstructured mesh.",
